# Build scratch. Regenerated by Unreal on every build and worthless to anyone
# pulling this repo.
Intermediate/
Saved/
*.sln
.vs/

# Debug symbols: 64 MB per build, and nobody consuming a plugin needs them.
*.pdb

# The DLL under Binaries/ is deliberately NOT ignored. Shipping it is the whole
# point of this repo -- it lets a Blueprint-only project use the plugin with no
# C++ toolchain installed.
